{"type":"text","timestamp":1790381118194,"sessionID":"ses_f24f8c487ffehkLXykVNGGHADj","part":{"id":"prt_0db07d2da001nrWQmEwdGSTWpJ","messageID":"msg_0db078a6a0013paJMK5hWg99mi","sessionID":"ses_f24f8c487ffehkLXykVNGGHADj","type":"text","text":"The existing scene already has the requested `CameraNode/CameraActual/Camera3D` hierarchy and exported node paths; the missing work is the shake configuration and behavior. I’m preserving that structure, adding a serialized `FastNoiseLite`, and keeping impulses in local camera space so the effect remains independent of player world orientation.","time":{"start":1790381118170,"end":1790381118173},"metadata":{"openai":{"itemId":"msg_0bf132702bc37946016ab70c395af087d090336735bd27dabc","phase":"commentary"}}}}
